{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":116207,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"karleealyssa,\n\nstreelbride has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"GSP Wedding!!\".\n\nstreelbride said:\n======================================================================\nHey congrats to you too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \nI think the ballpark amount for the chillout reception is $100 a person with a 40 person minimum. You can have less than 40 people but you'd still have to pay for 40.\n \nI can send what the wedding coordinator sent to me. The info for that will be in the private parties document.\n \nWe are having our ceremony at 4:00 at the Riviera Gazebo and then we're just eating on the buffet since I have a lot of food allergies and children (8) at the wedding. It will just be easier than doing  a set menu at a restaurant which was our original plan <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> since you only get one selection for the menus there.\nI'm having a beach cocktail reception with a dj from 8-11 possibly with some hor's d'oeuves.\n \nHave you booked your trips yet? Our prices were a bit high since we are going during spring break <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> My fiance is a teacher and that's the only time other than summer that we could do it.\n \nI will email you the info from the resort shortly,\n \nhappy planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\nSarah\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11406&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":283685,"Name":"streelbride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283685.jpg?_r=1437401496","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442052088,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11406},{"Id":116092,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nemmapalmer just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHello!!!Just wanted to let you know I am planning my wedding at the GSP for May 15th 2017 and your threads are very informative!Thank you for all the time you have put into this !!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1904543\n","Sender":{"Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441981423,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":115584,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"karleealyssa,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome karleealyssa to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello karleealyssa,\n\nWelcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.    \n\nHere are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.     \n\n  If you have not done so, you may want to:     \ncomplete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)\nvisit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself  \nStart your own wedding planning blog  \nfind the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in\n \n  Here are some links that may be helpful to you:     \nDestination Wedding Community & Forum  \nResort Reviews  \nWedding Vendor Reviews  \nDestination Wedding Tips and Articles  \nWedding Image Gallery  \nBDW Help Page  \nBDW Forum Rules and Etiquette  \nHow to Download Attachments  \n \n  Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:     \n\nModerators and Community Leaders     \nTammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW  .  Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006\nAlexisinJamaica   - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.\n \nIf you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:   \nBDW on Facebook   \nBDW on Twitter   \nBDW on Pinterest   \n \n  If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,   please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com .   \n\n Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!      \n\nPlease feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.    \n\nTeam BDW    \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11380#msg20365\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441807062,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11380}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"3","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
