253,252,250)'><span  style='font-size: 14px'><span  style='color: rgb(178,34,34)'><strong class='bbc'>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span  style='color: rgb(24,24,24)'><span  style='font-family: arial'><span  style='font-size: 12px'><span  style='background-color: rgb(253,252,250)'><strong class='bbc'>Moderators and Community Leaders<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><ul class='bbc'><li><strong class='bbc'><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW<\/span><\/a><span  style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>.<\/span><\/strong>Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<\/li><li><strong class='bbc'><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>AlexisinJamaica<\/span><\/a> - Moderator & Community Leader.<\/strong>Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<\/li><\/ul>\n<span  style='font-family: arial'><span  style='font-size: 12px'><strong class='bbc'>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><ul class='bbc'><li><a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>BDW on Facebook<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/li><li><a href='http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>BDW on Twitter<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/li><li><a href='http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>BDW on Pinterest<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul>\n<span  style='color: rgb(24,24,24)'><span  style='font-