{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":116740,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that ashhtayy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79584-azul-fives-20162017\/?view=findpost&p=1904716\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"hirvine83\" I'm getting married at AF June 7th, 2016. Selecting the resort was definitely the hardest part...until I laid my eyes on the Sky Deck and then I was sold. Although I too haven't done much planning we are booked for a 4:30 ceremony followed by a cocktail hour at the sky bar and reception on the Sky Deck. \n\nJust an FYI if you do go with AF - there is a fee for the Sky Deck. We booked and got it for $1700 but I believe it's gone up to $1800. In my mind it's well worth it for that fantastic view <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\nHappy Planning!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1442289101,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":116628,"Title":"liked a post you made in Azul Fives 2016\/2017","Message":"Hello!\n\nmotherofbridejanuary2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi Everyone! My fiance and I are in the very beginning stages of planning our wedding in the Mayan Riviera for either November 2016 (likely) or Jan\/Feb 2017 (less likely). We are still trying to narrow down properties but I have so far absolutely fallen in love with Azul Fives, especially the...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79584-azul-fives-20162017\/?view=findpost&p=1904576\n","Sender":{"Id":284812,"Name":"motherofbridejanuary2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442263974,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":116513,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"hirvine83,\n\nreynbow has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Congratulations\".\n\nreynbow said:\n======================================================================\nOops, I meant Melissa Mercado, not Michelle: http:\/\/melissa-mercado.com\/\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11427&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":276575,"Name":"reynbow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276575.jpg?_r=1424562947","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442246115,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11427},{"Id":116510,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"hirvine83,\n\nreynbow has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Congratulations\".\n\nreynbow said:\n======================================================================\nThanks for your email. And congrats on your engagement and upcoming wedding!\n \nNot sure if you have this website, but it's for weddings at Karisma properties and if you're planning your wedding with their coordinators, Lomas. This website shows you all the options for decorations, flowers, DJ, photographer, etc:\n \nhttp:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/\n \nWe went to the Brides Dress Rehearsal and got to meet Lomas' photographers and view their work. But we ended up picking an outside photographer in part because we needed 4 days of shooting and Lomas' pricing didn't work for us.  We liked Sarani's work, but didn't care much for the work of the other photographers.  If you haven't heard about the Brides Dress Rehearsal, I'd be happy to share info. I highly recommend going to one if you're able to.\n \nIn case you don't know, Karisma charges $800 per outside vendor. However, if your vendor is a \"guest\" that stays 3 nights at the resort, then they waive the vendor fee. We paid for a room that was split between our outside DJ and photographer, so it ended up being about $600\/vendor instead of $800. But I heard that Azul Fives doesn't allow outside DJs anymore.\n \nAs for our photography package cost, since we paid for 4 days of shooting, this info probably won't be helpful for you. But our photographer, Pixan, does offer competitive pricing. If you're interested in hiring an outside DJ, I'd recommend Pixan and two other photographers, Naal Photography and Michelle Mercado.\n \nHope this info is helpful. Feel free to contact me with any additional questions. And good luck planning!\n \n-Reyna\n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11427&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":276575,"Name":"reynbow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276575.jpg?_r=1424562947","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442245643,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11427},{"Id":116224,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"hirvine83,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome hirvine83 to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello hirvine83,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11421#msg20410\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"Photo