Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":11,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":747,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1903520,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1440655281,"LastPoster":{"Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1903520,"PostDate":1440655281,"PostContent":"Hey everyone! I'm jacky, and I'm planning on getting married hopefully in March of 2017.  March 1...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrae2958@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440025420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackyrae","Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.118.235.207","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by jackyrae, 26 August 2015 - 10:05 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1440655548,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc079581e59edb3715881fc14e3f069d","RawContent":"Hey everyone! I&#039;m jacky, and I&#039;m planning on getting married hopefully in March of 2017.  March 14th marks the anniversary of out first date in 2014, and we want to make it our official anniversary. It&#039;s still ways away from now, and under some circumstances at home, I can&#039;t really make definite plans yet \n\n\nOne of my top resorts is Dreams Tulum, Playacar Palace, and Now Jade or Now Sapphire. I attended my best friend&#039;s wedding at Playacar Palace and I really loved it there. It seems to be exactly what I want but, I don&#039;t know because, I mean, she had her wedding there, so is it right that I do it too there? It&#039;s a little expensive, too (which is the issue with most of my choices) \n\n\nThese other resorts seem to have everything I want also. Anyone a bride at any of these resorts?","Attachments":[],"Id":1903520,"PostDate":1440655281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey everyone! I'm jacky, and I'm planning on getting married hopefully in March of 2017.  March 14th marks the anniversary of out first date in 2014, and we want to make it our official anniversary. It's still ways away from now, and under some circumstances at home, I can't really make definite plans yet <br><br>\nOne of my top resorts is Dreams Tulum, Playacar Palace, and Now Jade or Now Sapphire. I attended my best friend's wedding at Playacar Palace and I really loved it there. It seems to be exactly what I want but, I don't know because, I mean, she had her wedding there, so is it right that I do it too there? It's a little expensive, too (which is the issue with most of my choices) <br><br>\nThese other resorts seem to have everything I want also. Anyone a bride at any of these resorts?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrae2958@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440025420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackyrae","Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.192.32.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5833bf2f644236751ff5a609bcf349e2","RawContent":"I just got back from now sapphire . Truly a beautiful resort !! The staff\/ food everything was perfect. I still have to do my review but I have no complaints ! Other than the ocean... But that&#039;s not the resorts fault.. Most of riviera Maya was having a seaweed problem ... But who know so far away from now what will be the case . They did a beautiful wedding! My guests ( from Long Island which is know to have the craziest of weddings ) said it was the best wedding ever  and not just because of the DW . Any questions feel free.","Attachments":[],"Id":1903528,"PostDate":1440685540,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just got back from now sapphire . Truly a beautiful resort !! The staff\/ food everything was perfect. I still have to do my review but I have no complaints ! Other than the ocean... But that's not the resorts fault.. Most of riviera Maya was having a seaweed problem ... But who know so far away from now what will be the case . They did a beautiful wedding! My guests ( from Long Island which is know to have the craziest of weddings ) said it was the best wedding ever  and not just because of the DW . Any questions feel free. <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1903528]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-279723-0-64626300-1440681807.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg - Size: 86.9KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-279723-0-64626300-1440681807.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lornj29@aim.com","IpAddress":"68.192.37.147","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410112620,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lornj29","Id":279723,"Name":"lornj29","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ddd9ab9e3cd5ac3b0c61e6f19354e18","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, Jacky and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All the wedding venues you&#039;re considering are lovely - so if it helps to take some pressure off, whichever one you choose will made beautiful backdrops for your wedding photos......as seen here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153477913829487.1073741942.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Dreams Tulum Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342556757_o.jpg\" alt=\"11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153446501084487.1073741939.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Playacar Palace Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11698724_10153446506429487_4795504585474416289_o.jpg\" alt=\"11698724_10153446506429487_4795504585474\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153455288424487.1073741940.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Jade Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11700726_10153455296239487_8193843878115225725_o.jpg\" alt=\"11700726_10153455296239487_8193843878115\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452497034_o.jpg\" alt=\"11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Sapphire Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jpg\" alt=\"1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903574,"PostDate":1440710043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, Jacky and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All the wedding venues you're considering are lovely - so if it helps to take some pressure off, whichever one you choose will made beautiful backdrops for your wedding photos......as seen here:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153477913829487.1073741942.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Tulum Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342556757_o.jpg\" alt=\"11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153446501084487.1073741939.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Playacar Palace Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11698724_10153446506429487_4795504585474416289_o.jpg\" alt=\"11698724_10153446506429487_4795504585474\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153455288424487.1073741940.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Jade Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11700726_10153455296239487_8193843878115225725_o.jpg\" alt=\"11700726_10153455296239487_8193843878115\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452497034_o.jpg\" alt=\"11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Sapphire Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jpg\" alt=\"1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb5d3464fd98ce40e47db38bc0810dad","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jackyrae\" post=\"1903520\" timestamp=\"1440651681\"]\nHey everyone! I&#039;m jacky, and I&#039;m planning on getting married hopefully in March of 2017. March 14th marks the anniversary of out first date in 2014, and we want to make it our official anniversary. It&#039;s still ways away from now, and under some circumstances at home, I can&#039;t really make definite plans yet\n\nOne of my top resorts is Dreams Tulum, Playacar Palace, and Now Jade or Now Sapphire. I attended my best friend&#039;s wedding at Playacar Palace and I really loved it there. It seems to be exactly what I want but, I don&#039;t know because, I mean, she had her wedding there, so is it right that I do it too there? It&#039;s a little expensive, too (which is the issue with most of my choices)\n\nThese other resorts seem to have everything I want also. Anyone a bride at any of these resorts?[\/quote]@[member=\"jackyrae\"] have you thought of having your wedding in the other palace resorts in the area? such as the beach palace cancun? i have been to all them in the Riviera Maya and their food is amazing. \n\nHappy Planning\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1903629,"PostDate":1440742965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jackyrae, on 26 August 2015 - 10:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey everyone! I'm jacky, and I'm planning on getting married hopefully in March of 2017. March 14th marks the anniversary of out first date in 2014, and we want to make it our official anniversary. It's still ways away from now, and under some circumstances at home, I can't really make definite plans yet<br><br>\nOne of my top resorts is Dreams Tulum, Playacar Palace, and Now Jade or Now Sapphire. I attended my best friend's wedding at Playacar Palace and I really loved it there. It seems to be exactly what I want but, I don't know because, I mean, she had her wedding there, so is it right that I do it too there? It's a little expensive, too (which is the issue with most of my choices)<br><br>\nThese other resorts seem to have everything I want also. Anyone a bride at any of these resorts?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284488\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284488-jackyrae\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jackyrae<\/span><\/a> have you thought of having your wedding in the other palace resorts in the area? such as the beach palace cancun? i have been to all them in the Riviera Maya and their food is amazing.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c7985a2bb8f294a5c2f1b27c3038160","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dreamweddings\"], I would like to be a little further than the Cancun area. I visited the Cozumel Palace last time I vacationed there and while it was nice, I didn&#039;t like that they don&#039;t have much of a beach. I don&#039;t think it will be much of a problem having my wedding at the Palace Playacar. We all loved it and yes, they did have great food. I will be able to make definite plans in the next couple of months!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903679,"PostDate":1440789533,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a>, I would like to be a little further than the Cancun area. I visited the Cozumel Palace last time I vacationed there and while it was nice, I didn't like that they don't have much of a beach. I don't think it will be much of a problem having my wedding at the Palace Playacar. We all loved it and yes, they did have great food. I will be able to make definite plans in the next couple of months!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrae2958@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440025420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackyrae","Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a54f177b5ce5926c3b8983d19d2e32c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jackyrae\"] that is great to hear , you have already had good experience with the resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903716,"PostDate":1440824231,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284488\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284488-jackyrae\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jackyrae<\/span><\/a> that is great to hear , you have already had good experience with the resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.113.222.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e7ab16ca82f4dc51e0f62a31d1deb6e","RawContent":"I think if you had your wedding at the same resort where your friend did would be ok. You are having yours 2 years away and you will still make it your. Even though you use the same place.","Attachments":[],"Id":1903752,"PostDate":1440977152,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think if you had your wedding at the same resort where your friend did would be ok. You are having yours 2 years away and you will still make it your. Even though you use the same place.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440298010,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.14.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2e2409eb8931efcb4ceb53cd7e3262c","RawContent":"@[member=\"lorishultz2016\"] I think it would be ok, too. The more I think about it, the more I keep thinking that PLayacar Palace and Dreams Tulum are my top favorites and will be either one I choose. I&#039;m just hoping that my friends (her husband included) wouldn&#039;t mind coming back to the Playacar palace again for another wedding. She will definitely be my bridesmaid. I just really loved pretty much everything about the palace and the resort credits are really attracting me there.  So where are you having your wedding at lorishultz","Attachments":[],"Id":1903761,"PostDate":1441002464,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284536\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284536-lorishultz2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lorishultz2016<\/span><\/a> I think it would be ok, too. The more I think about it, the more I keep thinking that PLayacar Palace and Dreams Tulum are my top favorites and will be either one I choose. I'm just hoping that my friends (her husband included) wouldn't mind coming back to the Playacar palace again for another wedding. She will definitely be my bridesmaid. I just really loved pretty much everything about the palace and the resort credits are really attracting me there.  So where are you having your wedding at lorishultz\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrae2958@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440025420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackyrae","Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.113.222.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de809203d200e441cff863d44b8bc56e","RawContent":"You need to think of it this way. It&#039;s your wedding and what you want so they should not mind. And they are going to be on vacation at a place they liked to. We are looking at some place in at Thomas or st Lucia. I am having trouble finding a place.","Attachments":[],"Id":1903824,"PostDate":1441077905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You need to think of it this way. It's your wedding and what you want so they should not mind. And they are going to be on vacation at a place they liked to. We are looking at some place in at Thomas or st Lucia. I am having trouble finding a place.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440298010,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a7405138250560e3cd211d81812afc5","RawContent":"@lorishultz yeah, I definitely know that in the end, it&#039;s about where we want to go and not about anyone else (although we do want to be accommodating to everyone). I guess I&#039;m more concerned about the fact that we&#039;ve already been there only 3 years ago and maybe we should go somewhere else that we haven&#039;t been yet. We don&#039;t get to take vacations like this that often. St. Thomas and St. Lucia are so gorgeous. I wish I could go there, (especially the Turks and Caicos) but it&#039;s a little out of our budget.","Attachments":[],"Id":1903839,"PostDate":1441088325,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @lorishultz yeah, I definitely know that in the end, it's about where we want to go and not about anyone else (although we do want to be accommodating to everyone). I guess I'm more concerned about the fact that we've already been there only 3 years ago and maybe we should go somewhere else that we haven't been yet. We don't get to take vacations like this that often. St. Thomas and St. Lucia are so gorgeous. I wish I could go there, (especially the Turks and Caicos) but it's a little out of our budget. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrae2958@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440025420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackyrae","Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79538","Title":"New Bride For 2017","LastPostDate":1441910051},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
