{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79538,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7162f1ae2658249cb614ec39a835ecfe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;Dear Jacky,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;Congratulations on your anniversarie!!,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;Las Caletas coul be the best place for your celebration. As a &amp;nbsp;truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81810]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81810]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81681]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81681]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81804]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81804]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For more information please visit:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.vallarta-adventures.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.vallarta-adventures.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;http:\/\/www.vallarta-adventures.com\/weddings&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904467,"PostDate":1441910051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#696969\">Dear Jacky,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\">Congratulations on your anniversarie!!,\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\">Las Caletas coul be the best place for your celebration. As a \u00a0truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81810-intimate-ceremony\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_3171030.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Intimate Ceremony'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Intimate Ceremony' id='sml_image_view_81810' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81810-intimate-ceremony\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_3171030.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Intimate Ceremony'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Intimate Ceremony' id='sml_image_view_81810' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81681-jt-051915-610\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_3275662.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='J&T 051915 610'  width='200' height='134'  alt='J&T 051915 610' id='sml_image_view_81681' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81681-jt-051915-610\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_3275662.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='J&T 051915 610'  width='200' height='134'  alt='J&T 051915 610' id='sml_image_view_81681' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81804-tropical-colors\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_7180955.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Tropical colors'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Tropical colors' id='sml_image_view_81804' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81804-tropical-colors\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_7180955.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Tropical colors'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Tropical colors' id='sml_image_view_81804' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For more information please visit:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.vallarta-adventures.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.vallarta-adventures.com\/<\/a><a>and\u00a0http:\/\/www.vallarta-adventures.com\/weddings\u00a0<\/a> <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343062403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
