{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":20449,"Author":{"Id":284595,"Name":"hirvine83","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1442289996,"Content":"Hi! Thanks for your response! I see you live in Toronto! I'm in Ottawa. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I hope this isn't an overly personal or inappropriate question, but approximately how much are you anticipating the sky deck wedding and then cocktail hour and reception (private I assume?) is going to cost you? I can't even imagine what the costs will be so I am finding it difficult to budget! An approximately would be very helpful. So far I am thinking sky wedding, sky deck cocktail hour and a private garden reception...??? Who knows! What did you have to put down for a deposit to hold your date?thanks again","PostKey":"9530af4688ebf5dc59f6925f93b8556b","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}